# A module that drives the rx loop only through run_rx_loop_with_shutdown,
# where the control socket is bound, is missing from node-synthetic.
expect exit 1
expect FAIL [profile.ci] node::tests::rx_shutdown::drives_the_rx_loop_until_shutdown runs in no group, needs node-synthetic: module rx_shutdown is flagged (rx_shutdown::drives_the_rx_loop_until_shutdown uses run_rx_loop
